# Testing

- Frontend: Playwright against `https://$STAGING_HOST`. HTTP 200 is not a UI pass.
- Check computed styles and rendered DOM, not only that a `<style>` tag exists.
- API: `tests/e2e-suite.js` may use curl-style HTTP; assert JSON shape, not status alone.
- Pass counts live only in `tests/REPORT.md`.
- Work `docs/SPEC-GAPS.md` lowest FIX-ID: failing test first.
